{"about_the_game":"Occult Chambers is a single player narrative game that immerses players in the eerie <br>and mysterious valleys of the Himalayas. The game delves into the darker side of Indian mythology, exploring the horror elements of ancient occult rituals and the fantastical creatures<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2277830/extras/e5fd99a33c5df917184a250051ebefa4.poster.avif?t=1744898781\" width=548 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2277830/extras/e5fd99a33c5df917184a250051ebefa4.webm?t=1744898781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2277830/extras/e5fd99a33c5df917184a250051ebefa4.mp4?t=1744898781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u3000<br><br>Dhruv has always been sceptical of the mythological stories he grew up listening to. <br>However, when his father suddenly disappears and allegations surface that he has killed<br>an entire village and performed bizarre occult rituals, Dhruv is forced to confront the<br>possibility that these stories may be true. He sets out on a quest to find his father and<br>uncover the truth. In this journey, he finds himself in abandoned forts and chambers<br>filled with dark and terrifying occult activities. As he draws deeper into the mysteries<br>of these ancient rituals, his own beliefs are put to the test as he fights to uncover the<br>truth about his father and the world he thought he knew.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2277830/extras/e8a2225eb4f3dada185b268033cc33ce.poster.avif?t=1744898781\" width=548 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2277830/extras/e8a2225eb4f3dada185b268033cc33ce.webm?t=1744898781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2277830/extras/e8a2225eb4f3dada185b268033cc33ce.mp4?t=1744898781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Occult Chambers has challenging puzzles, spell-casting, and battles with mythical creatures. The game features unique combat with ancient weapons rather than modern firearms, adding an extra layer of immersion to the journey.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spell casting</h2>Mastering the art of spell-casting, memorizing incantations, and successfully casting spells is a crucial gameplay mechanic in the game.<br>\u3000<br>\u3000<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2277830/extras/d7ba7b14f4128a696e1069dfcd50cccc.poster.avif?t=1744898781\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2277830/extras/d7ba7b14f4128a696e1069dfcd50cccc.webm?t=1744898781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2277830/extras/d7ba7b14f4128a696e1069dfcd50cccc.mp4?t=1744898781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzles</h2>Occult Chambers features unique and one-of-a-kind puzzle designs, with a wide variety of environmental puzzles inspired by mystical themes and ritualistic mechanics.<br>\u3000<br>\u3000<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2277830/extras/1940b8b4711c30d2375cf26cc47cba60.poster.avif?t=1744898781\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2277830/extras/1940b8b4711c30d2375cf26cc47cba60.webm?t=1744898781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2277830/extras/1940b8b4711c30d2375cf26cc47cba60.mp4?t=1744898781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2>Experience intense battles against fantastical creatures using a variety of ancient, primitive melee weapons and ranged weapons. The combat system emphasizes strategy and skill, as players must use both their weapons and their mastery of spell-casting to defeat their enemies.<br>\u3000<br>\u3000<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2277830/extras/3c7a49ad316bfb14a3f08a8e15ec7774.poster.avif?t=1744898781\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2277830/extras/3c7a49ad316bfb14a3f08a8e15ec7774.webm?t=1744898781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2277830/extras/3c7a49ad316bfb14a3f08a8e15ec7774.mp4?t=1744898781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2277830?t=1744898781","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2277830/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744898781","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2277830/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744898781","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2277830/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744898781","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"General Mature Content - Experience intense battles against fantastical creatures as we fight "},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Occult Chambers is a single playe